---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
           <div class="content article-page">
               <div class="card">
                <h1>About My Profitland</h1>
                <p class="meta">auth : <span>Mina Boles</span> | published on feb 2026</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <img class= "article-image" src="imgs/mpllog.PNG" alt="">
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <p>
                 <strong>My Profitland </strong>is an economy-based game like real life. Many professions you can choose there, you can be a worker, businessman, fighters, and many more things to get virtual euro in this game, and the virtual euro can withdraw into real money.
                </p>
                <p>To register in this game is not difficult, you just provide email and phone number for verification. <strong><a href="https://myprofitland.com/game/Minanashaat">Click here</a></strong> to register, You will see the web page as shown below</p>
                <p>
                 Click Register now, its free orange button and you will see the register form like this
                </p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                <img class= "article-image" src="imgs/signup.PNG" alt="">
            </div>
                <p>
                 Enter your email, password and confirm password, then click register. Check your email and follow the instructions on the email. Enter your username, your real name, your real nationality, and choose what virtual country you want to start this game.
                </p>
                <p>ok, step 1 verification is successful!</p>
                <p> Step 2 verification is phone number, go to setting on right top of the site (blue button with white gear). click Account verification. enter your mobile phone and click save. you will get a verification code . use it .and you get full verification and you can open free utilities companies.
                </p>

            </div>

</Layout>
